      "held_out_question_id": "instr-rust-edition-003-q1",
      "question": "When migrating an existing project to Rust 2024 Edition according to the frozen Edition Guide, which Cargo command should be run to apply edition compatibility fixes, which keyword is newly reserved, and which two std::env functions are newly unsafe in the 2024 Edition?",
